 class=\"ds-ink\" transform=\"rotate(305 50 50)\"/><rect x=\"49.5\" y=\"18\" width=\"1\" height=\"37\" rx=\"0.5\" class=\"ds-ink\" transform=\"rotate(60 50 50)\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"1.8\" class=\"ds-ink\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-caption\"><b>Dress</b><span>Reference</span><span>Weddings, dinners</span></div></div>",
